**`app/auth.py`** — `require_api_key` now returns 401 when the `X-API-Key` header is missing or not in `VALID_API_KEYS`, otherwise returns the mapped username.

**`app/main.py`**
- `GET /tasks` — optional `status`, `priority`, `assigned_to` filters (combinable), then `page`/`page_size` slicing (`Query(ge=1)` rejects `page=0`/`page_size=0` with 422).
- `POST /tasks` — auth-required, 404 if `project_id` unknown, IDs auto-generated as `max(existing) + 1`, returns 201 with the created task.
- `PUT /tasks/{task_id}` — auth-required, partial updates via `model_dump(exclude_unset=True)` so omitted fields are untouched, 404 if not found.
- `DELETE /tasks/{task_id}` — auth-required, removes and returns the task, 404 if not found.

